# Density Compare
# Gallium (Ga) — real density 5.91 g/cm³. equal masses: Gallium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Gallium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 11.1mm color: #c28f8f at (-20mm, 5.5mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 47.1 g — the water cube is the reference
